From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Maxim Stepanov <g.maxim.stepanoff@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 23 Jul 2026 01:05:18 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] strip: complete Zed-cloud edit-prediction removal
 (v1.10.3/v1.11.3)

Folds the edit-prediction cloud-strip re-derivation done during the rebase into one
patch: zeta.rs keeps only self-hosted (Ollama / OpenAI-compatible) + Mercury paths,
edit_prediction.rs drops all Zed-cloud egress, license_detection re-added, cloud tests
removed.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
